                                                "sense_id": "8257eda4-d529-35e3-8c00-a45b6d9794e5",
                                                "text": "That same year, a young Gloria Steinem went undercover as a Playboy Bunny at one of his Playboy Clubs and wrote a stinging inside critique of the magazine's ethos and chauvinism in an article, titled \"A Bunny's Tale,\" which was published in Show magazine."
